      "text": "```\nINTERNATIONAL HEALTH REGULATIONS (IHR 2005):\n  Legally binding international agreement among 194 WHO member states.\n  Revised after SARS 2003 demonstrated inadequacy of 1969 IHR."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-PANDEMIC-RESPONSE.md#005",
      "path": [
