        "title": "Pandemic Response",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CORE OBLIGATIONS:\n  1. Develop core public health capacities (Annex 1A — 13 areas)\n  2. Notify WHO of events that may constitute PHEIC (within 24 hrs of assessment)\n  3. Not to implement travel/trade measures more restrictive than WHO recommendations\n  4. Maintain points of entry (PoE) surveillance capacity"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-PANDEMIC-RESPONSE.md#006",
      "path": [
        "09-PANDEMIC-RESPONSE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
