        "section": "public-health",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Pandemic Response",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ANNEX 2 DECISION INSTRUMENT:\n    4 conditions that must always be notified: smallpox, polio, novel influenza\n    subtype, SARS. Any other condition: use 4×4 matrix:\n    [Is it unusual/unexpected? × Serious public health impact? ×\n     Significant international spread risk? × Travel/trade restrictions risk?]\n    Any 2 \"Yes\" answers → notify WHO"
    },
    {
