      "text": "INDIVIDUAL LEVEL:\n  Hand hygiene:\n    Reduces respiratory infection risk ~16-21% (systematic review)\n    Most effective when combined with other measures\n    Mechanism: fomite transmission, not primary for aerosols"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-PANDEMIC-RESPONSE.md#012",
      "path": [
        "09-PANDEMIC-RESPONSE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:public-health:09-pandemic-response, git-history:public-health:09-pandemic-response]",
        "canonical_path": "public-health/09-PANDEMIC-RESPONSE.md",
