        "section": "public-health",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Pandemic Response",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "N95/FFP2 respirators:\n    70-85% reduction in infection risk for wearer (well-fitted)\n    Bangladesh RCT (N=350K): surgical masks: ~11% reduction in COVID symptomatic infection\n      Note: RCT in real-world community setting; lower than lab estimates\n    Respirators > surgical masks for aerosol protection"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-PANDEMIC-RESPONSE.md#013",
      "path": [
        "09-PANDEMIC-RESPONSE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
