        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Pandemic Response",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Physical distancing:\n    >1 meter distance: RR reduction ~82% vs. <1 meter (Lancet meta-analysis)\n    Aerosol transmission dominates over ~1 meter → distance matters less\n    Ventilation more important for aerosol transmission"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-PANDEMIC-RESPONSE.md#014",
      "path": [
        "09-PANDEMIC-RESPONSE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
